@page
@model PrivacyModel
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Storage and privacy";
}
<h1>@ViewData["Title"]</h1>

<section class="surface">
    @if (StorageConfiguration.Value.IsLocal)
    {
        <p>This app stores videos and job metadata on this machine, outside the public web directory.
            @if (!SpeechConfiguration.Value.Enabled && !SpeechConfiguration.Value.SynthesisEnabled && !OpenAIConfiguration.Value.Enabled)
            {
                <span>It does not send content to Azure or any AI service.</span>
            }
        </p>
    }
    else
    {
        <p>This app uploads videos and job metadata to a private container in Azure Blob Storage.
            The configured account is in New Zealand North.</p>
        <p>Private container means anonymous access is disabled; it does not mean a storage private endpoint
            is configured. This development instance authenticates with your Azure CLI login over HTTPS.</p>
    }
    @if (SpeechConfiguration.Value.Enabled)
    {
        <p>Extracted audio is sent over authenticated HTTPS to Azure Speech in Australia East for English
            transcription. Time-coded transcripts are saved with the job. This crosses New Zealand's border.
            Speech is not configured with a private endpoint; this differs from the OpenAI connection requirements.</p>
    }
    @if (SpeechConfiguration.Value.SynthesisEnabled)
    {
        <p>Voice previews send the selected segment's current text, including unsaved edits, to Azure Speech
            in Australia East over authenticated HTTPS (not a private endpoint). Synthesis is billable.
            Preview audio is stored privately with the job; previous preview versions remain until manually deleted.
            Generating a preview does not save your script edits or render a video.</p>
        <p>Approving full audio generation freezes a copy of the saved script, voice and timings with the job.
            Uncached spoken segments are sent to the same Speech resource for billable synthesis.
            Raw segment audio and the assembled timed WAV are retained privately with the job.
            Rendering requires a separate confirmation after audio review.</p>
    }
    <p>@(OpenAIConfiguration.Value.Enabled ? "English transcript text is sent to OpenAI in Australia East through the approved private endpoint. The connection rejects public or unapproved IPs."
        : "Live OpenAI translation is disabled until private routing and permissions are verified. No transcript is sent to OpenAI.")
        Machine translations and separate edited scripts are stored alongside each job. Private networking does not keep AI processing within New Zealand.</p>
    <p>Files are retained until manually deleted by the developer. There is no automatic retention policy yet.</p>
    <p>Confirmed rendering downloads the original video and approved audio to a unique local temporary folder.
        FFmpeg replaces the original audio and includes switchable subtitles. The final MP4, UTF-8 WebVTT,
        approved script snapshot and completion manifest are stored privately with the job.
        Rendering does not make additional AI requests. Playback/downloads go through the app, not public Blob URLs.
        Temporary rendering and download files are cleaned after processing or response disposal; crashes may leave files.</p>
    <p>Uploaded videos are downloaded to a unique temporary processing folder for local FFprobe validation
        and FFmpeg audio extraction. The folder is cleaned after success, failure or graceful shutdown.
        A crash may leave temporary files requiring developer cleanup.</p>
    <p>This local app has no user authentication. A job URL contains a random identifier but is not a substitute
        for access control. Do not expose this instance publicly or use it for sensitive footage.</p>
    <p class="mb-0">Before production deployment, add appropriate access controls, private Blob containers,
        managed identity, retention rules and a privacy policy reflecting the actual Azure integrations.</p>
</section>
